Subject: [PATCH v4 1/3] drm/xe: Attempt to bring bos back to VRAM after
 eviction
Date: Thu,  4 Sep 2025 18:07:13 +0200
Message-ID: <20250904160715.2613-2-thomas.hellstrom@linux.intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.50.1
In-Reply-To: <20250904160715.2613-1-thomas.hellstrom@linux.intel.com>
